            <td data-label="Mid-career (3-5 yrs)">{item.mid}</td>
            <td data-label="Senior level (5-8+ yrs)">{item.senior}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Figures are drawn from current Indian salary trackers and industry reporting for 2025-2026, and reflect roles focused specifically on social media, not the broader "digital marketing manager" title, which often blends SEO, paid search, and email marketing into a wider and higher-paying scope. Ranges vary by city, company size, and industry - compare more than one source before treating any single number as a guarantee.
  </p>

  <h2 id="freelance-pricing">What freelance social media management actually pays per client</h2>

  <p>
    Freelance pricing in India is genuinely wide, mostly because "social media management" can mean anything from a light organic-only package to a full paid-ads and reporting operation.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
