          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Ad-spend budget (the money a client pays directly to Meta, Google, or another platform) is always separate from your management fee - never fold ad spend into your own pricing, or a client will assume your fee already covers it.
  </p>

  <h2 id="demand">Why demand keeps climbing in India</h2>

  <p>
    This is not a soft, feel-good claim about "social media being important." It shows up as hard ad-spend data and a clear, documented shift in hiring patterns.
  </p>

