    This closing test turns the 3 Lanes framing from earlier into an actual next step. Move through these four checks in whatever order makes sense for you - some people can work through all four in one focused stretch, others need a longer stretch while juggling college or a job. Either pace works, as long as you answer all four honestly before committing months of unpaid effort or a client's budget to one lane.
